# PropLine key from https://prop-line.com (free, 1,000 requests a day).
# The default feed, and the one to get first: it bills one request per game
# whatever the market list, so a full NBA night is 16 requests of the 1,000 and
# the whole eleven-market board comes back for the price of four. It also
# carries the lines PrizePicks and Underdog are actually posting, which is what
# a pick'em entry has to be built at. Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in.
PROPLINE_API_KEY=

# Odds feed key from https://the-odds-api.com (free tier: 500 requests a month).
# Optional, and the sharper of the two: it is the only feed here that carries
# Pinnacle's player props, the strongest reference there is. It bills per market
# per game, so a full NBA night at five markets is 70 of the 500 -- about seven
# presses a month. Worth having for a Pinnacle read on a prop you are about to
# bet; it is the wrong feed for pulling a slate every night.
ODDS_API_KEY=

# With neither key the app has no prices and will say so rather than invent an
# edge. With one, it selects that feed on first run; with both, PropLine.
#
# Both lines above: a key here takes precedence over the one in Settings, so
# leave a line blank rather than filling it with a placeholder. Write the key
# bare, with no quotes and nothing after it, and restart the app after editing.
